 from [SelfBody #632](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/issues/632) and [#648](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/648): **after original Node/Java shutdown**, read prior exact same-Action S16/native/S50 MotionCompanion in an independently identified **internal** cognition epoch, without claiming a later native S49/L0 epoch.\n\nBased on the original actual physical `DEV_WORLD_SELFBODY_S16_S50_JOIN_PASS` exact HEAD `0ee72bc7fdabf26be905ba51779ecb1a1b1f1a99`. The old World3 evidence/FAIL originals, main, S49/S16/S50 owners, P1/M/L8 are unchanged.\n\n## Changes\n- `PostWorldInternalEpochLease` demands a previously S16/native-qualified typed `SelfBodyS50MotionCompanion`, and successful owner-observed existing Node/Java exit. Creates new internal epoch using **original** `compose_self_body_view` and `compose_self_world_view` with `observation=None`, `outcome=None`; current Body/World UNKNOWN. Separately calls `read_previous_experience()` once to expose prior Action/source IDs and S50 Paper motion (historical samples only). Original previous typed source is not reconstructed from report JSON. Duplicate, failed process exit, invalid owner source, replay fail closed.\n- Original single-Action DEV host `self_body_s50_world_dev.qualify` adds **default OFF** `postworld_internal_epoch_dev` plus `--selfbody-postworld-internal-epoch-dev`. It calls new internal epoch only after original real S49/S16/native/S50 join and Node/Java clean shutdown, in same process, without issuing another probe/Action/model or modifying original L0.\n- Focused tests (synthetic original-typed closure and existing owner API), GitHub CI; [contract & local physical DEV runbook](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/blob/dev/selfbody-s50-postworld-internal-epoch-20261031/docs/selfbody-s50-postworld-internal-epoch-dev-20261031.md).\n\n**Evidence ceiling:** offline after-shutdown API integration until a *new* DEV World opt-in run. Original World3's “next epoch referenced=false” does not change. This is NOT fresh native Present, real next L0 decision, full-tick idle, physical stability, Goal, P1 recovery, L10 or SCIENCE. Avoids S50 mid-session TRACE_END contract. Draft only; no main merge.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T11:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T11:22:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"638f611e596b6f8d57dec07afd58362883debee0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rinsakamo:dev/selfbody-s50-postworld-internal-epoch-20261031","ref":"dev/selfbody-s50-postworld-internal-epoch-20261031","repo":{"id":1371331707,"node_id":"R_kgDOUbzcew","name":"relay-self","full_name":"rinsakamo/relay-self","owner":{"login":"rinsakamo","id":272078660,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDeXRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272078660?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo","html_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Persistent cognition, present projection, and embodied control runtime for Relay.","homepage":"","language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["agent-architecture","autonomous-agents","cognitive-architec